/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  henry_sander -- the Henry-water records of data/standards/parameters/Henry/ made from
  Sander (2015) Table 6 (DEV.md 4c C321, CC-BY 3.0, doi:10.5194/acp-15-4399-2015).
  rows.tsv holds every M and L row of every catalogue species with the page it was read
  on; summary.tsv the median, spread and status of each (new = promoted; heldSpread =
  spread above 3x; heldNoEnthalpy = fewer than 2 d ln H/d(1/T) values: the loader REFUSES
  a record without `enthalpy`, so none is written).  bin/curate/henry_sander.py rebuilds
  them; bin/curate/check_henry_records.py holds each record to rows.tsv.  Each operation
  asks the evidence card of one record.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
